# Downloaded miner binaries (tools/fetch-miners.sh)
miners/

# Agent tool configuration and per-tool instruction files.
#
# AGENTS.md is the cross-tool standard and stays tracked: it is the single
# authoritative description of how to build, test and extend this crate.
# Every tool-specific equivalent is local to one contributor's setup, so it
# is ignored rather than committed. Put project instructions in AGENTS.md.
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
.claude/
.codex/
.mcp.json
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.clinerules
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Implementation plans are working scratch, not project documentation.
# Specs under docs/superpowers/specs/ stay tracked; plans do not.
docs/superpowers/plans/
.plans/
